{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>Why this should I find, etc.</b> That is, why does he lavish his love upon him in this particular matter — he prefers to maintain with him a continuous state of finding favor for the future rather than do for him this thing now. And this is what he said: ״אֶמְצָא חֵן בְּעֵינֵי אֲדוֹנִי״ — in the future tense."], :book :genesis, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:45:44.250285046Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}